close_reason: "Decision recorded and executable evidence passes: explicit iterative topological ordering remains required for correct oldest-first replay."
body: "Options considered: delete topoSort and rely on Set iteration order; retain the iterative parent-before-child traversal; replace it with recursive traversal. Retain the iterative traversal. Reachability yields the source tip before its ancestors, and a multi-commit rebase proves replay must reverse that discovery order. Push-time deduplication also makes diamonds linear and recursion would risk stack exhaustion on machine-generated history."
